              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ni unami wenu mwagwisisye mbwayi ŵandu ŵangu ŵambone ŵele Une nganisakaga kuti agwe mbwaji. Mwalimbisye mtima ŵandu ŵangalumbana kuti akaleka ulemwa",
          "type": "text",
