        {
          "text": "Sambano ya ŵakulocesya yenu ya unami yimwatiga myiweni m'mesomkulola yila yimasile. Ngwakulupusya ŵandu ŵangu kutyoka mu ulamusi wenu, myoyo timcimanyilila kuti Une ni AMBUJE.”",
